+ * texture with a VkImage. So: export the resource as an NT shared handle, convert it to a host fd
+ * the same way cuImportExternalMemory already does, import that as CUDA external memory, and map
+ * it as a mipmapped array. The CUgraphicsResource we hand back is our own object; the cuGraphics*
+ * entry points below recognise it and service it, and pass everything else through untouched.
