+ * Each step logs on failure, because the one thing that cannot be settled by reading source is
+ * whether the texture's Vulkan memory was allocated EXPORTABLE -- DXVK only does that for
+ * resources created shared. If it was not, CreateSharedHandle fails and we are no worse off than
